    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passé simple",
     "texto": [
      "The **passé simple** narrates completed events in stories, history and literary press. Recognize common forms such as **il entra**, **elle prit**, **ils furent**; in conversation the passé composé is usually used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passé antérieur",
     "texto": [
      "The **passé antérieur** is formed with the passé simple of the auxiliary + the past participle: **Quand il eut terminé, il partit**. It marks an action before another one narrated in the passé simple. It is a reading tense, not a priority for everyday speech."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Earlier action",
